   "en": "No matter what happens, I'll only look at you, Nonoka and Kyoichi, who have had a one-sided love affair, are now boyfriend and girlfriend! At home, at school and on dates, Kyoichi is sweetly pressing her in every way he can, and Nonoka is thrilled to no end. Nodoka wants to respond to Kyoichi's feelings and \"wants\" to do it herself, but when Kanzaki, a woman claiming to be Kyoichi's fiancée, appears, a dark cloud hangs over the relationship between the two - ?"
